<title>FINLAND: Finnish 2006 bond yields 6.34 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>Finnish 2006 bond yields 6.34 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/96 bond was announced by the State Treasury Office :</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     18-04-2006</p>
<p> COUPON:				 7.25 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			6.34 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  106.20</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 2,490 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 3,088 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>NOTES: The previous auction of the bond raised 1.12 billion markka at a price of 105.45 and a yield of 6.45 percent. After today's auction, the outstanding amount is 19,282 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0240</p>
